's Actually Different\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Book covers and album covers look similar on the surface, but the design rules — composition, typography, genre signaling — are genuinely different. Here's how.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/images/cover-art/cover-08.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"21\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg?icon.1hqt-6fdfs6lm.svg\",\"sizes\":\"any\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2a\",\"22\",{}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[53501,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"\"]\n4:I[85437,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"Image\"]\n20:X\n25:X\n25:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"Ci70N7G2LBQG0cqRgP2oF\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] py-12 border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-4xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider hover:underline inline-block mb-6\",\"children\":\"← Back to All Guides\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]\",\"children\":\"Design Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"September 3, 2025\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"6 min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl uppercase leading-tight text-[var(--ink)] mt-2\",\"children\":\"Book Cover vs Album Cover Design: Key Differences Every Artist Should Know\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--ink)]/20 font-mono text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Written by:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"py-16 bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-3xl space-y-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--paper-2)]/90\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/cover-art/cover-08.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Book Cover vs Album Cover Design: Key Differences Every Artist Should Know\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"On the surface, a book cover and an album cover are doing the same job: a single illustrated image that has to grab attention fast and signal what's inside. But the actual design rules underneath are different enough that treating them the same produces weaker results in both directions.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Format and Shape Change Everything\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"An album cover is a fixed square (1:1). A book cover is a tall rectangle, and that single shape difference cascades into almost every other design decision.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Square composition\"}],\" (album) tends to center a single strong focal point — one character, one scene, one striking image\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Vertical composition\"}],\" (book) has room for a foreground/background relationship, layered depth, or a scene that unfolds top to bottom\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"An illustration built for one format rarely just \\\"crops\\\" cleanly into the other — this is why book covers and album covers are usually designed as separate pieces from the ground up, not adapted from each other.\"]}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]}],\"$L1a\"]}]}],\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\"]}],[\"$L1d\"],\"$L1e\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@1f\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L21\",\"isPartial\":\"$@22\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L23\",\"isPartial\":\"$@24\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":\"$25\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L26\",\"isPartial\":\"$@27\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":\"$25\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L28\",\"isPartial\":\"$@29\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@2a\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@2b\"}\n2c:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n2d:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2e:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n30:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n31:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n32:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n33:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n34:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b2j6nos8u62l.css\",\"style\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Typography Plays a Bigger Structural Role on Book Covers\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Album covers can often work with minimal or no text — visual recognition and platform metadata do a lot of the identification work. A book cover almost always needs to carry the title and author name as load-bearing elements of the composition, not an afterthought.\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This means book cover illustration has to leave deliberate space and visual \\\"quiet zones\\\" for text from the sketch stage onward — something that matters far less on an album cover where text is often optional or minimal.\"]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Genre Signaling Works Differently\"}]\n9:[\"$\",\"p\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Album covers signal mood and identity — dark, bright, chaotic, minimal — tied to an artist's existing visual brand. Book covers have to signal \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"genre\"}],\" almost instantly, because that's how readers browsing a shelf or an online store filter their choices.\"]}]\na:[\"$\",\"li\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"A thriller cover uses different color logic (high contrast, limited palette, tension in negative space) than a cozy fantasy cover (warm palette, more detail, inviting composition)\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Romance, horror, sci-fi, and literary fiction each have visual conventions readers unconsciously use to sort books before reading a single word of the blurb\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Illustrators moving between album and book cover work need to actively study genre conventions for whichever category they're working in — the \\\"read the room\\\" instinct that works for a music release doesn't transfer directly to genre fiction shelving expectations.\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Series Consistency Is a Bigger Deal for Books\"}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A musician might release one striking, standalone cover per single. A book series, on the other hand, usually needs a consistent visual system across every volume — repeated typography placement, a recognizable color logic, and often a recurring compositional structure so the whole series reads as a set on a shelf or storefront grid.\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This makes book cover commissions, especially for series, closer in complexity to manga cover work than to a one-off album single cover.\"]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Where They Overlap\"}]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Despite the differences, the underlying commission process is largely the same:\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"li\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Reference gathering and mood-setting\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"li\",\"39\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"A sketch/composition approval stage\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"li\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Genre or brand-appropriate color and rendering choices\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Format-specific file delivery (print bleed and DPI for books, streaming-optimized files for albums)\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Illustrators who work across album covers, manga, and book-adjacent illustration — like \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"commission work here\"}],\" — apply this same structured process regardless of format, which is really the constant across all of it, even as the design rules themselves shift.\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Book and album covers aren't interchangeable design problems even though they're both \\\"just\\\" a single illustrated image with a job to do. Format, typography needs, genre signaling, and series consistency all pull in different directions — worth knowing whether you're commissioning one or briefing an artist on either.\"]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-brand font-anton text-[28px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"JHAY SANYAY\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-sub font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Visual Artist & Illustrator · Nigeria\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-links flex gap-[20px] font-mono text-[12px] mt-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/portfolio\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Portfolio\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Guides & Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://linktr.ee/jhaysanyay\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Linktree ↗\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Job Ticket\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] text-[var(--yellow)] mt-[20px] tracking-wider uppercase\",\"children\":[\"designed by \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/buildwithclinton/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--paper)] hover:text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline transition-colors\",\"children\":\"buildwithclinton ↗\"}]]}]]}]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\",\"async\":true}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2e\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@2f\"}]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L30\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2e\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Book Cover vs Album Cover Design: What's Actually Different | Jhay Sanyay Studio\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Book covers and album covers look similar on the surface, but the design rules — composition, typography, genre signaling — are genuinely different. Here's how.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\